// All 285 questions of esg-passport's built-in templates (src/data/questionnaire-templates.js)
// mapped onto canonical ids. These are our own paraphrases of the frameworks, so they double as
// the matcher's English test set. `note` marks multi-part questions whose second half needs a
// second record.
